{"page":20151,"part":1,"text":"书丹\n\n\n笔得墨则瘦，得朱则肥。故书丹尤以瘦为奇，而圆熟美润常有馀，燥劲老古常不足，朱使然也。欲刻者不失真，未有若书丹者。然书时盘薄，不无少劳。韦仲将升高书凌云台榜，下则须发已白。艺成而下，斯之谓欤！若锺繇、李邕，又自刻之，可谓癖矣。\n\n\n【空白页】","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20151,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"d3821be27e476a305991ee67f4ff6c5eb3aed8a033fd7670edcec187758bf33b","textSha256":"d3821be27e476a305991ee67f4ff6c5eb3aed8a033fd7670edcec187758bf33b","fileSha256":"d3821be27e476a305991ee67f4ff6c5eb3aed8a033fd7670edcec187758bf33b","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20151-work-119.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"续书谱 · 书丹","sourceUrl":"","originalPages":[407,408],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":3,"sourceTextSha256":"e6fb8a5065b01c7f019642dede518be565e9286341dc09535656fa0a40a60a49","id":"local-407-0-9","page_id":407,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":9,"reviewedTextSha256":"220ff927ccc58c68e291c750aeee5e5837fc461de81cfa620e48e7b0c4155971","displayUnitOrigins":[[6,7],[7,8],[8,9]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":407,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T14:20:29.680Z","revision":"220ff927ccc58c68e291c750aeee5e5837fc461de81cfa620e48e7b0c4155971","textSha256":"220ff927ccc58c68e291c750aeee5e5837fc461de81cfa620e48e7b0c4155971","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":5,"end":118,"sourceTextSha256":"0921af1f3345f883a5b25f5bd648d9713bbaab97473b89d04c1758366f2fbd47","id":"local-407-9-142","page_id":407,"origin":"legacy